  <item>
    <title>vol.8｜此物乃是猪蹄?.No No No,这玩意儿叫万三蹄</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67a34554d74435e4a33f9854</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67a34554d74435e4a33f9854</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 05 Feb 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>听众朋友们大家好，欢迎收听历史呓语，我是阿xing。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>过年好，过年好，今天我们来了解一下拥有“聚宝盆”的平民财神，沈万三的故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>同时附上</span><strong><span>万三蹄膀的烹饪教程</span></strong><span>：</span></p><span></span><p><span>1.将猪肘放开水锅内煮至五成熟后取出，擦干皮面的水，趁热抹上炒好的糖色，稍微放凉后放入八九成的热油中炸到微红，捞出控油，用刀在肉面楔成核桃形的小块（深到肉皮）。</span></p><span></span><p><span>2.锅内加底油烧热，加白糖炒至深红色时加清汤、绍酒、酱油、精盐、葱姜、猪肘、用花椒、大料，桂皮，砂仁，豆蔻，丁香，草果，小茴香，制成一个药料袋放人锅内，用慢火炖至八成熟时，取出猪肘，皮面朝下，放大碗内加原汤、葱姜，上锅蒸至酥烂，把汤滗出来，猪肘直接扣在盘内。</span></p><span></span><p><span>3.将原汤倒入锅里加味精烧开，用淀粉勾荧，淋上花椒油，最后把汤汁浇在猪肘上即成。吃的时候是用肘子中的一根细骨代刀。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>参考书目</span></strong><span>：《明史》《云焦馆记谈》《吴风录》《周庄镇志》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>参考影视</span></strong><span>：《聚宝盆》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>BGM</span></strong><span>： Europe —— Jay Someday</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Stormwind —— Hotham</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间轴</span></strong><span>：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="51">0:51</a> 背景</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="151">2:31</a> 陆氏赠财</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="215">3:35</a> 陆地海洋两开花</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="330">5:30</a> 经商理念</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="367">6:07</a> 城门失火，殃及池鱼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="556">9:16</a> 茶马古道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="652">10:52</a> 万三蹄</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="810">13:30</a> 聚宝盆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1030">17:10</a> 生活在现代的沈家后人</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/67309c4d6793cdec0e29687a/llCD8UBSW8OIugyKX9Ib-XjxAxjZ.m4a" length="28154735" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:19:24</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fuo2ADTzwXE5Kx5eyDJ1M1xczUc9.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
