  <item>
    <title>vol.6｜拉斯普京.拥有魅魔体质的不死妖僧</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67875861b21f1c0fb309008b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67875861b21f1c0fb309008b</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 15 Jan 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>听众朋友们大家好，欢迎收听历史呓语，我是阿xing。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>本期内容的主人公是沙俄时期著名的奇人拉斯普京，相信知道他的朋友也肯定了解他的一些壮举。拉斯普京杀不死的故事可谓最让人称奇，而他死后，口碑也出现了两极分化。拉斯普京到底是怎么从一个无恶不做的地痞无赖发展成为沙皇的座上宾呢，而他真实的为人，是否就是故事里所写的那样秽乱宫廷呢？让我们一起了解一下拉斯普京的故事吧。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>参考书目：</span></strong><span>《拉斯普京：信仰，权力，和罗曼诺夫皇朝的黄昏》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>参考影视：</span></strong><span>《格里高利·拉斯普京》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>BGM：</span></strong><span>Hope – Wanheda</span></p><span></span><p><span>Moonwalk – Jay Someday</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间轴：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="45">00:45</a> 奇怪的绰号</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="81">01:21</a> 荒唐的统治者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="154">02:34</a> 早熟的少年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="223">03:43</a> 成年入鞭身</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="327">05:27</a> 抛妻弃子瞒身世</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="383">06:23</a> 机遇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="494">08:14</a> 皇宫座上客</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="584">09:44</a> 贵妇收割机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="699">11:39</a> 干涉朝政</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="777">12:57</a> 杀不死的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1022">17:02</a> 不一样的说法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1202">20:02</a> 最后</span></p>]]></description>
